      "writtenOn": "2022-05-04T16:46:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In order to reduce the wait, I would suggest to wait before and after NPCX_HIPMIC(PMC_ACPI) \u003d NPCX_VW_SMI(0). We tested this approach successfully on Monday.\nThis is more efficient and it reduces the overall time wasted waiting as the wait time after NPCX_HIPMIC(PMC_ACPI) \u003d NPCX_VW_SMI(1); is usually absorbed by code execution time.",
      "revId": "de4281998daed99f21055dcae63d9f6f564b750e",
